						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														well my computer is now FIXED.  but it doasnt seem to matter much with all the fighting that has been going on in my absence the guild has dwindled down to a narrow few   so i guess i will just start all over again with fresh people except for those of you who are still here.  i cant belive that all this is going on  this guild was ment to form friendships and alliances  and now 2 of my most helpful officers are leaving also   and i still dont have any damn reason why.    well  i am going onto eq to try to straiten this out if i cant then   fresh start     as i said POTD is about freindship and helping each other and this is getting just plain dumb   for those of you wh0 have deserted  ***waves bye***<br />
<br />
and for those of you who are still here lets try to drop all this dumb fighting and REBUILD and have FUN  remember this IS A GAME!!!<br />
<br />
see you all in game						</td>
